  "releaseNotes": "v.2.0.2\n- Moved Option.Some<TValue>() to Option<TValue>.Some(), same for None\n- Added Wrappers for Option<TValue>.Some/None as Option.Some<TValue>() / None<TValue>() for backwards compatability\n- Made Option<TValue> constructor private\nv.2.0.1\n- Change Result type to be class instead of record\n-> To improve ergonomics when chaining .Map and such\nv.2.0.0\n- Add proper nuv.Option namespace\nv.1.0.3\n- Add new Option.Map variant that takes an Action<T>\nv.1.0.2\n- Add support for NETStandard 2.0\nv.1.0.1\n- Add function summaries\nv.1.0.0\n- Initial Release",
